{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50399","headline":"十一 · 王梵志","name":"十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"立身行孝道，有事莫爲●。\n（「有事」，伯三五五八、伯三七一六卷作「省事」。\n）行使长无过，（「行使」，伯三六五六卷作「但使」，伯三七一六卷作「但知」，斯三三九三卷作「但能」。\n）耶娘高枕眠。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50399.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50399","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}